      "narration_text": "And the single fact that would save a new developer the most time. The tutor's model isn't installed anywhere. It's a name sent with each request, so changing it is one environment variable and a restart. Which means if the tutor goes silent, the model is almost never the cause. Check the key and the billing first.",
